  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But Bartleby has another side, a side of which I think even he is unaware: the hub of possibility, the domain of what could be or could have been.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_123.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We stand at the exact antipode of the Ravenwood, its direct opposite in the Spiral - a land down under, you might say.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_124.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Here, the World Tree dreams. And from his unconscious imaginings come new realities.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_125.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But this Dreamer is as unaware of the material world as Bartleby is of him. Thus, we made Sybil to bridge the gap and advance the Arcanum's studies.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_126.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now, Wizard, plant that sprig we took from her in the dirt you brought from Novus. Connect Dasein to this place, to this inspiration.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_127.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Was it all you had hoped, Wizard? You did not face your demons, nor realize your truth as we all did.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_131.mp3",
